cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Detection-Rules: Cross-Platform Detection Rules Library"
message: >-
  If you use this dataset in academic or industry research, please cite it
  using the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Wahid
    family-names: Hendrawan
    email: wahidhendrawan@users.noreply.github.com
    affiliation: Independent Detection Engineer
abstract: >-
  Detection-Rules is a cross-platform library of detection rules and hunting
  queries — Sigma, Elastic, Splunk, Microsoft Sentinel, Wazuh, and Carbon
  Black — mapped to the MITRE ATT&CK framework. The repository is intended
  as a starter pack for blue teams and detection engineers, with auto-
  generated coverage reports, threat-actor mapping, and Atomic Red Team
  verification references.
keywords:
